 "summary": "Three single silicon switching diodes in the two-lead SOD-323 surface-mount package, differing only in voltage rating: BAV19WS is rated 120 V, BAV20WS 200 V and BAV21WS 250 V repetitive peak reverse voltage. All three carry 200 mA average forward current, dissipate up to 250 mW, and recover in 50 ns max. The application named is high-frequency signal circuits at low voltage.",
